theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 12
text = "Hypertension is the force
 of blood against your
 artery walls is consistently
 too high, making your 
heart work harder and
damaging arteries over
 time, leading to risks of 
heart attackand stroke. 
It's often called the
 \"silent killer\"  symptoms,
 but readings of 130/80
 mmHg or higher 
indicate hypertension
"
horizontal_alignment = 1

